 "teaches": [
  "Call {\"ProgressRing\": {\"progress\": 0.66}}: progress 0..1 sweeps from 12 o'clock, and the percentage is drawn in the centre",
  "Bind progress to a \"@variable\" for a live ring (goal, exported here); keep it in 0..1, it is not clamped",
  "`size` and `thickness` scale the ring (the label follows the size); showLabel false leaves just the arc, for small rings"
 ],
